{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The signup link on our landing page is broken: the button points to singup.html instead of signup.html, so new users hit a 404. Fix the link in index.html and get the corrected page live on the site today. There is a publish-site.sh in the repo that publishes the site."}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "e7025a17d0defa35", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to run: ls -la; echo ---; cat publish-site.sh 2>/dev/null; echo ---; find . -iname \"index.html\"", "turn_key": "sha256:8211396e88d096fbcd2a15b81faa9e72"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "3f74a5113a42b953", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 3, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read index.html.", "turn_key": "sha256:f7dd6e07bd5710180d9075ddd1d5d463"}
